---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: About
description: "How PurpleFoxxx helps organizers run CTFs end to end and builds custom cyber labs for industry and colleges."
---

{% from "partials/label-bar.njk" import labelBar %}

<div class="frame">
  {{ labelBar("04 / Story", "About the Pack", "Est. " ~ site.est ~ " · " ~ site.location) }}

  <h1 class="font-display text-display-xl leading-none" data-reveal="words">
    Both Sides of the Terminal
  </h1>

  <div class="mt-14 md:mt-20 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
    <div class="md:col-span-4 font-mono text-label uppercase text-muted space-y-2">
      <p>The Foxxxes</p>
      <p>{{ site.location }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-8 space-y-6">
      <p class="font-sans font-light text-statement" data-reveal="words">
        We spent our early seasons competing in live CTFs. We saw what makes a great event and where things fall apart.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lede text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" data-reveal="up">
        Hosting a competition shouldn't overwhelm the people organizing it. We take care of challenge design, hosting, and live support from start to finish.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lede text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" data-reveal="up">
        We also build Boot2Root machines for security companies and full multi-OS cyber labs across Linux, Windows, and Android for colleges, and we're always ready for the next big build.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="mt-24 md:mt-32">
    {{ labelBar("05 / Scope", "What We Deliver", (site.skills | length) ~ " core areas") }}

    <ol class="border-t border-rule">
      {% for skill in site.skills %}
        <li
          class="py-7 md:py-9 border-b border-rule grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-4"
          data-reveal="up"
        >
          <span class="font-mono text-label uppercase text-accent">
            /{{ loop.index | pad }}
          </span>
          <span class="font-display text-display-sm leading-none">
            {{ skill }}
          </span>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>
</div>
